# AetherWallet no longer uses any server-side API key.
#
# The Gemini "Transaction Guard" now runs with BYOK (Bring Your Own Key):
# each user enters their own Gemini API key in Settings, it is encrypted with
# their master password and stored only on their device, and the wallet calls
# Google directly from the client. Without a key, the guard falls back to a
# fully local heuristic mode.
#
# APP_URL: (Optional) The URL where this app is hosted, injected by AI Studio /
# Cloud Run. Only used for self-referential links.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"
